Escalate ONLY when: (1) the customer explicitly asks for a human;
  (2) the request falls outside documented policy (a gap);
  (3) you attempted resolution and cannot progress.
Do NOT escalate on frustration alone or a self-rated confidence score.
Multiple customer matches -> ask for email/phone/order number.

// Access failure -- consider retry
{ "status": "error", "failureType": "transient",
  "message": "Connection timeout after 30s", "shouldRetry": true }

// Valid empty result -- do NOT retry
{ "status": "success", "results": [],
  "message": "Query executed; no matching records.", "shouldRetry": false }
